---
<section class="sec sec-alt" id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-hdr"><h2>Everything you need to ship with confidence</h2><p>Enterprise-grade feature management on Firebase's free tier.</p></header>
    <div class="feat-grid">
      <div class="feat glass-card"><div class="feat-ic"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>Segments & Targeting</h3><p>Create reusable audience groups. Target by plan, country, device, or any attribute.</p></div>
      <div class="feat glass-card"><div class="feat-ic"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20V10"/><path d="M18 20V4"/><path d="M6 20v-4"/></svg></div><h3>Percentage Rollouts</h3><p>Gradually release to 5%, 20%, 50% of users with deterministic bucketing.</p></div>
      <div class="feat glass-card"><div class="feat-ic"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></div><h3>Secure by Default</h3><p>Client keys never expose targeting rules. Server evaluates, client receives values only.</p></div>
      <div class="feat glass-card"><div class="feat-ic"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>Team Collaboration</h3><p>Viewer, Editor, Admin roles per project. Full audit trail of every change.</p></div>
      <div class="feat glass-card"><div class="feat-ic"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"/><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"/></svg></div><h3>Webhooks</h3><p>Slack, Discord, Teams, Google Chat, or custom HTTP. Filter by event and environment.</p></div>
      <div class="feat glass-card"><div class="feat-ic"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg></div><h3>Zero Cost</h3><p>Runs on Firebase free tier. No per-seat pricing, no usage surprises. $0/month forever.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .feat-grid { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  @media(min-width:640px) { .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media(min-width:1024px) { .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  .feat { padding: 28px; border-radius: 18px; transition: transform .4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1), border-color .3s, box-shadow .4s; }
  .feat:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.14); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
  .feat-ic { margin-bottom: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
  .feat h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .feat p { font-size: 13.5px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
